OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWater company fined almost #8m for
OL,4,Asewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FOf the 18 charges, 17 were for illegal
OL,7,Fdischarge activities including sewage
OL,8,Fdischarges and one is for failing to
OL,9,Ftake reasonable remedial measures
OL,10,Ffollowing a failure at a sewage pumping
OL,11,Fstation. The firm was fined #7,867,733.
OL,13,FThe water company said in a statement
OL,14,Fafter sentencing: "We apologise for
OL,15,Fwhat happened in the past."
